<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>istillfeelthesame</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">5 Seconds of Summer</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">EVERYONE'S A STAR! (Fully Evolved)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6qpxQxwWnGWJ6v9sAK4LFX</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.399" end="00:13.865">I remember things</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.865" end="00:16.167">Only you would know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.167" end="00:18.978">Eyes running with mascara</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.978" end="00:21.436">You ask me to zip your dress and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.436" end="00:23.938">Go and get the car</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.938" end="00:26.487">How much can we take?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.487" end="00:28.954">Leaving your apartment</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.954" end="00:31.824">You lean in to kiss my neck and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.824" end="00:35.389" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.389" end="00:37.801">I still feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.801" end="00:40.305">Your heart's beating different</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.305" end="00:42.903">Show me nothing's changed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.903" end="00:45.282">Kiss me like you mean it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.282" end="00:47.982">I felt you slip away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.982" end="00:50.326">Talking in your sleep and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.326" end="00:52.933">I mean it when I say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.933" end="00:55.543">I still feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.543" end="00:57.606">I still feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.606" end="01:05.606" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.527" end="01:10.098">See it in your face, see it in your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.098" end="01:12.581">Taking down your hair while I'm trying to drive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.581" end="01:14.455">Trying not to stare, or we're gonna die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.455" end="01:17.048">You lean in to kiss my neck, I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.048" end="01:19.648">Got no sleep, my eyes are bleeding</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.648" end="01:22.082">Everything is losing meaning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.082" end="01:25.831">Tell me I'm your human being, my love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.831" end="01:27.331" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.881" end="01:28.349">I still feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.349" end="01:30.948">Your heart's beating different</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.948" end="01:33.416">Show me nothing's changed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.416" end="01:35.698">Kiss me like you mean it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.698" end="01:38.532">I felt you slip away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.532" end="01:40.856">Talking in your sleep and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.856" end="01:43.528">I mean it when I say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.528" end="01:46.148">I still feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.148" end="01:48.078">I still feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.078" end="01:56.078" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.238" end="02:00.238">I still feel the same</p></div></body></tt>